    <item>
      <title>Rapporto</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/Portfolio/en/posts/rapporto/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 07:07:07 +0100</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/Portfolio/en/posts/rapporto/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;senior-ios-developer&#34;&gt;Senior iOS Developer.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;march-2021--june-2026&#34;&gt;March 2021 — June 2026.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.rapporto.ru&#34;&gt;www.rapporto.ru&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;product&#34;&gt;Product:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rapporto is a B2B platform enabling banks and large retailers to send personalized push notifications with interactive multimedia content to their clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;key-achievements&#34;&gt;Key Achievements:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;sdk-architecture--functionality&#34;&gt;SDK Architecture &amp;amp; Functionality.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designed the architecture for two Rapporto iOS Push SDKs (Obj-C and Swift). The library ensures the delivery of push notification statuses (Delivered / Opened / Swiped) to the server. Correctly handles diverse content types - images, HTML, GIFs, video, and audio files. Added the ability to configure the app group name via the info.plist file.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Promsvyazbank</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/Portfolio/en/posts/psb/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 28 Feb 2021 17:10:17 +0300</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/Portfolio/en/posts/psb/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;senior-ios-developer&#34;&gt;Senior iOS Developer.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;september-2019--february-2021&#34;&gt;September 2019 — February 2021.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.psbank.ru&#34;&gt;www.psbank.ru&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;product&#34;&gt;Product:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mobile banking application for SMEs featuring online banking, document management, and support chats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;key-achievements&#34;&gt;Key Achievements:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;transition-to-adaptive-layout&#34;&gt;Transition to Adaptive Layout.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proposed migrating the team from Storyboard constraints to code-based adaptive layout using the SnapKit framework. The team implemented the transition. This not only significantly accelerated development but also later enabled a large-scale redesign. The updated design was well-received by users – the app&amp;rsquo;s average App Store rating increased from 3.2 to 4.6 within 6 months.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>MFC Webbankir</title>
