      <pubDate>Mon, 30 Sep 2019 17:10:36 +0300</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/Portfolio/en/posts/webb/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;senior-ios-developer&#34;&gt;Senior iOS Developer.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;october-2018--september-2019&#34;&gt;October 2018 — September 2019.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.webbankir.com&#34;&gt;www.webbankir.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;product&#34;&gt;Product:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An application for managing microloans and consumer lending for Webbankir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;key-achievements&#34;&gt;Key Achievements:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;release-manager&#34;&gt;Release Manager.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From February 2019, I took over application release preparation: organizing pre-release testing, final bug fixes, preparing marketing screenshots and App Store texts, and communicating with managers. Over 8 months, I managed &lt;strong&gt;6 releases and 5 hotfixes&lt;/strong&gt; — all successfully passed review, &lt;strong&gt;none&lt;/strong&gt; were rejected by Apple.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
